{
  "category": "Jolly Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "LOMBRE is nocturnal - it will get active after dusk. It is also a mischief-maker. When this POKéMON spots anglers, it tugs on their fishing lines from beneath the surface and enjoys their consternation.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "LOMBRE’s entire body is covered by a slippery, slimy film. It feels horribly unpleasant to be touched by this POKéMON’s hands. LOMBRE is often mistaken for a human child.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the evening, it takes great delight in popping out of rivers and startling people. It feeds on aquatic moss that grows on rocks in the riverbed.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.",
